(
A
) Quantitative statistics of lncRNAs, circRNAs, and miRNAs. (
B
) Analysis of differentially expressed lncRNAs, circRNAs, and miRNAs between LUAD and non-tumor samples. (
C
) Annotation of LUAD-related lncRNA markers based on the LncBook database. (
D
